                <div class="swiper-wrapper">
                                            <div class="swiper-slide">
                            <div class="card">
                                <h4 class="db-card-head">Training Programmes</h4>
                                <p class="db-card-desc">Get a data-driven glimpse of trainings in Capacity Building project and participation across nation. Explore key insights and trends shaping capacity-building efforts.</p>
