                                <a class="view-m-btn" target="_blank" href="https://app.powerbi.com/view?r=eyJrIjoiZWQxODA4OTItMDA3My00ZjkxLTllNzctOWNhZDQ1Zjg2YmEyIiwidCI6IjliZDllNTJjLWU1MGItNDUzYS04MzA0LTczMjY4NWM4Y2NlOSJ9"><span>View Dashboard</span> <img src="https://negd.gov.in/wp-content/themes/negd-update/assets/images/icon/arrow_forward.svg" alt="arrow-forward" /></a>
