                                <a class="view-m-btn" target="_blank" href="https://mail.mgovcloud.in/zm/reUrlCheck.do?url=https%3A%2F%2Fapp.powerbi.com%2Fview%3Fr%3DeyJrIjoiZjJkYjEyMWEtZjQ1Ny00MTE4LTg0MjktOTFjNTExM2U2ZTBiIiwidCI6IjliZDllNTJjLWU1MGItNDUzYS04MzA0LTczMjY4NWM4Y2NlOSJ9&"><span>View Dashboard</span> <img src="https://negd.gov.in/wp-content/themes/negd-update/assets/images/icon/arrow_forward.svg" alt="arrow-forward" /></a>
